  #line-at(72.024pt, 511.03pt, "Measuring light-responsive samples, which requires both a light source and X-rays, demands a careful ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 523.15pt, "selection of materials for the microfluidic device, considering also the limitations due to the fabrication ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 535.39pt, "processes at the micro scale. In the configuration shown in Figure 3(a), where the two light sources are ")
