  #line-at(189.29pt, 547.63pt, "the channel walls must be both resistant and transparent to X-rays, while ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 559.87pt, "providing a low background scattering signal. The top lid must be resistant and transparent to ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 571.99pt, "wavelengths above 340 nm, while the bottom lid only needs to withstand laser irradiation. To meet ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 584.23pt, "these requirements, SUEX and IM-PMMA were chosen as the device materials. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 596.47pt, " The transparency of the materials in the UV or visible range was evaluated by UV-Vis spectroscopy, as ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 608.59pt, "shown in Figure S1 of the supplementary information. For the top lid, the IM-PMMA slide of 125 µm ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 620.83pt, "thickness was chosen, as it is transparent down to a wavelength of 340 nm, while the bottom lid made ")
