  #line-at(72.024pt, 484.63pt, "transparency of a material to X-rays of a given wavelength is to determine its attenuation length, as it ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 498.07pt, "is independent from the material thickness. For this, the chemical composition of the material must ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 511.51pt, "be at least approximately known. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 524.95pt, "In the present case, SUEX is composed of a mixture of epoxy resins. The major components are ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 538.39pt, "Bisphenol A (BPA) and Bisphenol A diglycidyl ether (DGEBA). BPA can be described as C")
